{"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Moving from 2.0.x APIs to 2.1.0","modules":[{"name":"HaishinKit"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HaishinKit\/documentation\/HaishinKit","doc:\/\/HaishinKit\/documentation\/HaishinKit\/migration-guide"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Update code written for HaishinKit 2.0.x to use the 2.1.0 APIs.","type":"text"}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/HaishinKit\/documentation\/HaishinKit\/migration-2.2.x-to-2.3.x","doc:\/\/HaishinKit\/documentation\/HaishinKit\/migration-1.9.x-to-2.0.0"],"generated":true,"title":"Migrating to 2.x","anchor":"Migrating-to-2x"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a historical migration guide. Code examples refer to the versions shown in each section and may not match the current release."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Package","anchor":"Package","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this version, we have restructured the module configuration. The RTMP-related features that were previously in HaishinKit have been moved to RTMPHaishinKit."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Several classes that were previously at the public level have been changed to package-level and are no longer exposed."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Import","level":4,"text":"Import","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"20x","level":5,"text":"2.0.x","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import HaishinKit","","let connection = RTMPConnection()"]},{"anchor":"21x","level":5,"text":"2.1.x","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import HaishinKit","import RTMPHaishinKit","","let connection = RTMPConnection()"]},{"anchor":"Package-Manager","level":4,"text":"Package Manager","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/HaishinKit\/HaishinKit.swift\/discussions\/1672"},{"type":"text","text":", support for CocoaPods has been discontinued."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"20x","level":5,"text":"2.0.x","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"checked":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"CocoaPods","type":"text"}]}]},{"checked":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftPM","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"210","level":5,"text":"2.1.0","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"checked":true,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"SwiftPM","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"MediaMixer","level":3,"text":"MediaMixer","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Change-in-behavior","level":4,"text":"Change in behavior","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since around iOS 18, when attaching a device during capture with AVCaptureMultiCamSession, the application’s UI becomes locked for several seconds. To address this, we have changed the behavior to start capture manually."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"20x","level":5,"text":"2.0.x","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import HaishinKit","","let mixer = MediaMixer()","\/\/ Capture was automatically started under certain conditions.","await mixer.attachVideo(AVCaptureDevice.default(.builtInWideAngleCamera, for: .video, position: .back))","await mixer.addOutput(view)"]},{"anchor":"210","level":5,"text":"2.1.0","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import HaishinKit","","let mixer = MediaMixer()","await mixer.attachVideo(AVCaptureDevice.default(.builtInWideAngleCamera, for: .video, position: .back))","await mixer.addOutput(view)","","\/\/ Calling startRunning() is now required.","await mixer.startRunning()"]},{"anchor":"frameRate","level":4,"text":"frameRate","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Frame rate specification has been changed to allo